  "lab2-ldap-postgres/enterprise/active-directory/custom-values.ad.yaml": "Lab 2A · DX layer: authentication against Microsoft Active Directory with configOverrideFiles.\n# The ${AD_...} values are Open Liberty variables: they come from the dx-ad-bind secret (2a-ad/secrets.yaml).",
  "lab2-ldap-postgres/b-postgres/cluster-dx-pg.yaml": "Lab 2B · PostgreSQL 18 for the Web Engine, managed by CloudNativePG.\n# ⚠ PostgreSQL is not supported yet by HCL for the Web Engine: this is for learning the transfer process.",
